# 止蝕
(pos:動詞)
<explanation>
yue:喺投資或者買賣當中，為咗避免損失進一步擴大，喺蝕住嘅時候賣出資產離場
eng:to cut one's losses; to stop loss (in investment or trading)
<eg>
yue:隻股票跌咗咁多，都係止蝕離場好過。 (zek1 sik6 zo2 gam2 do1, dou1 hai6 zi2 sik6 lei4 coeng4 hou2 gwo3.)
eng:The stock has fallen so much; it's better to cut my losses and get out.

<eg>
yue:佢唔捨得止蝕，結果愈蝕愈多。 (keoi5 m4 se2 dak1 zi2 sik6, git3 gwo2 jyu6 sik6 jyu6 do1.)
eng:He was reluctant to cut his losses, and as a result he lost more and more. [end of text]


